# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only CUSTOM (user-authored) config is versioned here. This repo is PUBLIC.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Skills: keep only custom, user-authored skills. Everything else under skills/
# is one of:
#   - publicly installable  -> restored by ./install-skills.sh (`npx skills add`)
#   - Claude runtime state  -> synced/ buckets, etc.
#   - employer/personal-confidential -> must not be published (public repo)
# So ignore all skills except the custom ones re-included below.
skills/*
!skills/subagent-orchestrator/

# Claude Code runtime buckets (written into the symlinked config dirs).
synced/
**/.claude/

# Dependencies / build output (reinstalled).
**/node_modules/

# Local/runtime noise.
*.log
.DS_Store
